ownloaded scripts with pipes in Bash. \u2022 Protect SSH keys and use available APT sources. \u2022 Do not automatically mount reserved folders in unattended environments. \u2022 WSL requires virtualization and may require a reboot. \u2022 Linux processes consume resources only when they are started, unless services are started by the distribution.","\u00B7 Vista 3D pronta \u00B7":"\u00B7 Vista 3D pronta \u00B7","ASTRA Core":"ASTRA Core","ASTRA Creator":"ASTRA Creator","ASTRA Gaming":"ASTRA Gaming","Accessibilit\u00E0":"Accessibilit\u00E0","Action Checklist":"Action Checklist","Active Recall Cards":"Active Recall Cards","Aggiungi file\u2026":"Add file...","Aggiungi i risultati della simulazione":"Add simulation results","Aggiungi widget proposto":"Add proposed widget","Ambienti per scienza, tecnologia, ingegneria e matematica.":"Science, technology, engineering, and mathematics environments.","App di avvio":"Startup app","App predefinite":"Predefined app","Apri grafico 3D":"Open 3D graphic","Archiviazione":"Storage","Assistente vocale":"Voice assistant","Assistenza rapida":"Quick assistance","Audio e accessibilit\u00E0":"Audio and accessibility","Base64 Decoder":"Base64 Decoder","Base64 Encoder":"Base64 Encoder","Blocco note":"Note Block","CSV Bridge":"CSV Bridge","Calcola date di ripasso a \u002B1, \u002B3, \u002B7, \u002B14 e \u002B30 giorni.":"Calculate date of review \u002B1, \u002B3, \u002B7, \u002B14, and \u002B30 days.","Calcola il contrasto WCAG di due colori #RRGGBB.":"Calculate WCAG contrast of two colors #RRGGBB.","Calcola l\u0027impronta del testo inserito.":"Calculate the footprint of the text entered.","Calcolatrice":"Calculator","Catalogo launcher e strumenti per giocare mantenendo Windows invariato.":"Launcher for catalog and tools to play while keeping Windows unchanged.","Codice":"Code","Codifica testo UTF-8 in Base64; non \u00E8 cifratura.":"Encode text in UTF-8 Base64; not encryption.","Codifica una componente URL, senza aprire collegamenti.":"En